        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPG26, Heavy Duty Solid Brass 26\" Offset Security Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana 26\" Offset Surface Door Bolt is made of solid brass and available in 9 great finishes. It can be installed horizontally or vertically on the surface of almost any door. The guides on this heavy duty door bolt are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, hold tension on the bolt and prevents rattling of the guides. Package includes 26 inch surface bolt, mortise strike plate, universal strike plate, angle strike plate, 3 bolt guides and matching oval phillips head finish brass wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPG26.gif?v=1704354569\" width=\"600\" height=\"279\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FPG26 26\" Offset Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in other lengths: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-10-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg10\"><b>10\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-18-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg18\"><b>18\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-42-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg42\"><b>42\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FPG26 26 Inch Offset Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 25-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Offset: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection:  1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3 Strike Plates</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: oval phillips head #6 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FPG26.pdf?v=1704262229\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPG26 26 Inch Surface Bolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 26 Inch Offset Surface Bolt, Deltana FPG26",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass 26 Inch Offset Security Door Bolt, Deltana FPG26  - This Deltana 26 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolt is made of solid brass and available in 9 great finishes. It can be installed horizontally or vertically on the surface of almost any door. The guides on this heavy duty door bolt are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, hold tension on the bolt and prevents rattling of the guides. Package includes 26 inch surface bolt, mortise strike plate, universal strike plate, angle strike plate, 3 bolt guides and matching oval phillips head finish brass wood screws.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-FPG26 26-inch Offset Security Bolt Heavy Duty 26 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolts, deltana FPG 26 offset surface bolts, door slide bolts, 26 inch door bolts, 26 inches door bolts, slidebolts, deltana 26 inch offset surface bolts, surface mounted door bolts, long door bolts, large door bolts, long door rods, DEL-FPG2615, DEL-FPG2615A, DEL-FPG2619, DEL-FPG2610B, DEL-FPG2626, DEL-FPG2626D, DEL-FPG263, DEL-FPG265, DEL-FPG26CR003,"
